title: file:play
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File: play one file after another — the checked selection or the query shown

Starts a [[Slideshow]] in the [[file panel]]: `file:play selection` or `file:play query`,
followed by `shuffle`, `loop`, both or neither; `file:play stop` ends it. Starting one
while another runs replaces it.
